// Waveform tracing rules, read by scripts/sim.ps1 (used when running with -Trace).
// Signals excluded here are left out of the waveform at compile time.
// Uncomment and adapt the examples below; "*" and "?" are wildcards.
`verilator_config

// Leave out every signal declared in the files matching a pattern:
// tracing_off -file "*?rtl?some_file.sv"

// Leave out one scope and everything below it:
// tracing_off -scope "some_tb.some_instance*"

// Bring back part of what was left out, a number of levels deep:
// tracing_on -scope "some_tb.some_instance.some_child*" -levels 1
